# Agent skills
# Custom skills live in /skills/ (committed to git)
# External skills installed to .agents/skills/ (gitignored, manifest in .claude/skills.json)
# Agent directories (.claude, .cursor, etc.) symlink to .agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/.gitkeep
.agents/skill-updates.log

