.agent/
.cursor/
.trae/
.windsurf/

# Documentation review comments (dev-only)
.comments/

# VRT artifacts (baselines ARE committed, current/diff/actual are NOT)
**/test/vrt/__screenshots__/__current__/
**/test/vrt/__screenshots__/__diff__/
**/test/vrt/__screenshots__/__actual__/

